{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ReadAloud 可將 PDF、Word、EPUB、Kindle 文件、文章、相片或任何文字轉為自然語音並離線收聽，適合經常閱讀文件、需要同時處理工作與聆聽內容的用戶。目前該 App 終生版限時免費兌換中，原價為 US $129.99。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-10.webp\">\n<h2>離線聽讀多格式文件</h2>\n<p>ReadAloud: Text to Speech PDF 以裝置端語音將文字朗讀，支援 PDF、Word、EPUB、Kindle 文件、相片及網頁文章，覆蓋 60 多種語言，並可完全離線使用。它能自動偵測語言、於章節與頁面之間跳轉，提供 0.75x 至 2x 播放速度、句子高亮及背景播放，讓用戶在通勤或處理其他工作時持續吸收內容。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-387-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-388-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-389-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-390-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-391-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-392-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>ReadAloud: Text to Speech PDF 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5940\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5940-473x1024.webp\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ReadAloud: Text to Speech PDF</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>兌換位置：App Store （額滿即止）</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.315815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":477,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:18:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:52:37.775694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:53.991999+00:00","content_hash":"fc30c148dbe41cbf420a325c1d72935f9ed14aece8d80d6d30d6b7510c10e949","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}